Each ported module's header carries the attribution of the file it ports.

The built-in presets (assets/) are the eight Yamaha DX7 factory ROM
cartridges (ROM1A-ROM4B), from the original-cartridge collection at
yamahablackboxes.com, plus the three Finetales curated banks and a drum kit
assembled from the Dexed cartridge collection.
